        <item>
            <title>2.26.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 20:33:09 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>109</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.26.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes

- **A long message is no longer cut to a third of itself on the phone.** Canopy sent only the notification banner, capped at 2400 bytes — which is roughly 800 characters of Japanese — and the phone stored that as the whole message. The untruncated text now travels alongside it, so the conversation shows what the banner could not.
- **An AskUserQuestion's option descriptions reach the phone.** They were dropped from the push as the bulkiest part of the form, which was survivable only while the tool's raw input was still shown above the buttons. Once that duplicate was removed, a question whose labels are terse had nothing left explaining the difference between them.
]]></description>
